 "remarks": "LUXURY LIVING MEETS UNBEATABLE VALUE! Be the very first to live in this spectacularly renovated, ultra-modern 2BR/1BA first-floor apartment located just 1 block from Norwalk Hospital. Listed at $2,900/month, this commuter's dream saves you hundreds monthly with HEAT, COLD WATER, SEWER, TRASH, AND 2 PRIVATE OFF-STREET PARKING SPACES ALL INCLUDED in the rent! The brand-new, top-to-bottom remodel boasts a gorgeous chef's kitchen featuring premium stone countertops, new custom cabinetry, a deep-set sink, and stainless steel appliances (gas range, refrigerator, microwave). The pristine, fully updated bath features a new modern vanity, toilet, and designer lighting. Enjoy sleek modern flooring, fresh paint, upgraded electrical, and bright LED lighting throughout. Set in a quiet, professionally managed 6-unit building with refreshed common areas, smart motion LED lighting, on-site laundry, and a brand-new rear privacy fence. (Private basement storage available for a small fee). WALK-SCORE PARADISE: Steps to Norwalk Hospital, Metro-North train, Waypointe dining, and The SoNo Collection mall. Minutes to I-95, US-1, SoNo nightlife, and Calf Pasture Beach. Pet-friendly (restrictions/fee apply). No smoking. Available immediately. Credit check & 3x rent income required. Lead disclosure applies. 1st month's rent + security deposit due at signing. 1-year lease.",
